OL,3,GNEWSAWe face paying #9,000 tax because
OL,4,Aour second home is in a war zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ukrainian woman who fled to Scotland
OL,7,Fafter Russia invaded her homeland has
OL,8,Fbeen told she could face a #9,000
OL,9,Fproperty tax charge because she still
OL,10,Fowns a flat in Kyiv.
OL,12,FKateryna Stepanovych, 38, discovered
OL,13,Fthe potential charge when she tried to
OL,14,Fbuy a house in North Ayrshire with her
OL,15,FScottish partner Mattias Lindgren.
OL,17,FThe couple were told the Additional
OL,18,FDwelling Supplement (ADS) charge would
OL,19,Fapply because she already owned a
OL,20,Fproperty overseas.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
