OL,3,GNEWSAWe face paying #9,000 tax because
OL,4,Aour second home is in a war zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FKateryna bought the small flat in 2018,
OL,7,Fbefore Russia's invasion. She fled the
OL,8,Fwar zone in 2023, leaving the property
OL,9,Fbehind.
